+ *                userland needs a Home button; the Pixel has none)
+ * PMIC access is READ ONLY: the sole PMIC-side write issues EXT_READL on an
+ * observer channel. The volume GPIOs only get their pull-up (as Linux's
+ * tlmm_gpio_key_active pinctrl) if the bootloader left them without one.
